{"sha": "db157962049c64d71c7b565425ae1967f400fdade893bfe451bc5aa74243ecd3", "body": ["\\textbf{10.} 在第一象限中，星形线下方的区域", "面积为 $\\int_0^1 y\\,\\dd x$，其中 $x = \\cos^3 t$", "由 $1$ 减至 $0$，$t$ 从 $0$ 增至 $\\pi/2$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 y\\,\\dd x", "= \\int_{\\pi/2}^{0}\\sin^3 t\\,(-3\\cos^2 t\\sin t)\\,\\dd t", "= 3\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^4 t\\cos^2 t\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "降幂化简：$\\sin^4 t\\cos^2 t = (\\sin t\\cos t)^2\\sin^2 t =", "\\tfrac18\\bigl(\\sin^2 2t - \\sin^2 2t\\cos 2t\\bigr)$，且", "$\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^2 2t\\,\\dd t = \\tfrac\\pi4$，而", "$\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^2 2t\\cos 2t\\,\\dd t =", "\\bigl[\\tfrac{\\sin^3 2t}6\\bigr]_0^{\\pi/2} = 0$。于是", "积分为 $\\tfrac\\pi{32}$，第一象限面积为", "$\\tfrac{3\\pi}{32}$，封闭区域面积为 $4 \\cdot", "\\tfrac{3\\pi}{32} = \\tfrac{3\\pi}8$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 在 $\\gamma(t) = (t, t^2/2)$ 处，切线", "方向为 $(1, t)$，故法线为 $\\{(x, y) : (x -", "t) + t\\,(y - t^2/2) = 0\\}$，即 $x + t\\,y = t +", "\\tfrac{t^3}2$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $(a, b, c) = (1, t, t + t^3/2)$：$a' = 0$，$b' =", "1$，$c' = 1 + \\tfrac32 t^2$，$\\Delta = 1$。则 $y = ac' -", "a'c = 1 + \\tfrac32t^2$，且", "\\[", "x = cb' - c'b = t + \\tfrac{t^3}2 - t\\Bigl(1 +", "\\tfrac32t^2\\Bigr) = -t^3 .", "\\]", "消去 $t$：$t^2 = \\tfrac23(y - 1)$，且 $x^2 = t^6 =", "\\tfrac8{27}(y - 1)^3$：一条半立方抛物线，顶点为", "$(0, 1)$。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $T = (1, t)/\\sqrt{1+t^2}$，$N = (-t,", "1)/\\sqrt{1+t^2}$，且 $\\kappa = (1+t^2)^{-3/2}$，于是", "\\[", "\\gamma + \\frac1\\kappa N = (t, \\tfrac{t^2}2) +", "(1+t^2)\\,(-t, 1) = \\Bigl(-t^3,\\ 1 + \\tfrac32t^2\\Bigr),", "\\]", "与原曲线相同：法线的包络是", "曲率中心的轨迹，正如第 4 题所言。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $E'(t) = (-3t^2, 3t)$ 在 $t = 0$ 处为零；", "$E''(0) = (0, 3) \\neq 0$ 得 $p = 2$，且 $E'''(0) = (-6,", "0)$ 得 $q = 3$：$(0, 1)$ 处为第一类尖点。", "顶点处 $\\kappa = (1+t^2)^{-3/2}$ 取最大值，故", "$\\kappa'(0) = 0$，且渐屈线的速度", "$-\\frac{\\kappa'}{\\kappa^2}N$ 恰在该处为零，渐屈线的尖点", "位于曲率的极值点处。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 参数为 $t$ 的法线经过", "$(x_0, y_0)$ 当且仅当 $x_0 + t\\,y_0 = t + \\tfrac{t^3}2$，即", "\\[", "\\frac{t^3}2 + (1 - y_0)\\,t - x_0 = 0 ,", "\\]", "关于 $t$ 的三次方程，有一个或三个实根（不计重数，", "对一般点而言）。在轴 $x_0 = 0$ 上，它分解为", "$t\\bigl(\\tfrac{t^2}2 + 1 - y_0\\bigr) = 0$，其根为", "$t = 0$（轴即为顶点处的法线），以及", "$t = \\pm\\sqrt{2(y_0 - 1)}$，当 $y_0 > 1$ 时。综上，", "$y_0 < 1$ 时只有一条法线，$y_0 > 1$ 时有三条，而在 $y_0 = 1$ 处的", "三重根标志着渐屈线的尖点。一般地，", "三次方程的二重根意味着该点同时满足", "直线方程及其关于 $t$ 的导数 --- 即该点\\emph{位于", "包络上}：渐屈线恰为", "一条法线区域与三条法线区域之间的分界。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 镜面反射使入射方向的法向分量反号，", "切向分量保持不变：", "记 $u = \\langle u, n\\rangle n + u_{\\mathrm{tan}}$，", "则反射方向为 $u_{\\mathrm{tan}} - \\langle u,", "n\\rangle n = u - 2\\langle u, n\\rangle n$。此处 $\\langle u,", "n\\rangle = \\cos\\theta$，故", "\\[", "v = (1, 0) - 2\\cos\\theta\\,(\\cos\\theta, \\sin\\theta)", "= (1 - 2\\cos^2\\theta,\\ -2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)", "= -(\\cos2\\theta,\\ \\sin2\\theta).", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{17.} 反射光线经过 $P_\\theta =", "(\\cos\\theta, \\sin\\theta)$，方向为 $(\\cos2\\theta,", "\\sin2\\theta)$；一个法向量为 $(-\\sin2\\theta,", "\\cos2\\theta)$，故直线为", "\\[", "-\\sin2\\theta\\,(x - \\cos\\theta) + \\cos2\\theta\\,(y -", "\\sin\\theta) = 0,", "\\]", "而常数项为 $-\\sin2\\theta\\cos\\theta +", "\\cos2\\theta\\sin\\theta = -\\sin\\theta$：乘以 $-1$，", "得 $x\\sin2\\theta - y\\cos2\\theta = \\sin\\theta$。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $(a, b, c) = (\\sin2\\theta, -\\cos2\\theta,", "\\sin\\theta)$：$a' = 2\\cos2\\theta$，$b' = 2\\sin2\\theta$，$c' =", "\\cos\\theta$，$\\Delta = 2\\sin^22\\theta + 2\\cos^22\\theta = 2$。", "由克莱姆法则，再用积化和差公式：", "\\begin{align*}", "x &= \\frac{2\\sin\\theta\\sin2\\theta +", "\\cos\\theta\\cos2\\theta}{2}", "= \\frac{(\\cos\\theta - \\cos3\\theta) + \\frac12(\\cos\\theta +", "\\cos3\\theta)}{2} = \\frac{3\\cos\\theta - \\cos3\\theta}4,\\\\", "y &= \\frac{\\sin2\\theta\\cos\\theta - 2\\cos2\\theta\\sin\\theta}2", "= \\frac{\\frac12(\\sin3\\theta + \\sin\\theta) - (\\sin3\\theta -", "\\sin\\theta)}2 = \\frac{3\\sin\\theta - \\sin3\\theta}4 :", "\\end{align*}", "此即肾形线，是一条具有两个尖点的闭曲线。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 求导并因式分解，其中用到 $\\sin3\\theta", "- \\sin\\theta = 2\\cos2\\theta\\sin\\theta$，$\\cos\\theta -", "\\cos3\\theta = 2\\sin2\\theta\\sin\\theta$：", "\\[", "E'(\\theta) = \\tfrac34\\bigl(\\sin3\\theta - \\sin\\theta,\\", "\\cos\\theta - \\cos3\\theta\\bigr)", "= \\tfrac32\\sin\\theta\\,(\\cos2\\theta, \\sin2\\theta),", "\\]", "与第 16 题中的反射方向平行：每条", "反射光线都与焦散线相切，这正是包络", "性质所要求的。$E' = 0$ 恰在 $\\sin\\theta = 0$ 时成立：", "$E(0) = (\\tfrac12, 0)$ 与 $E(\\pi) = (-\\tfrac12, 0)$，即两个", "尖点。在直线方程中令 $y = 0$，得 $x\\sin2\\theta =", "\\sin\\theta$，故 $x = \\frac1{2\\cos\\theta} \\to \\frac12$，当", "$\\theta \\to 0$ 时，近轴光线交于距圆心 $R/2$ 处 ---", "这就是球面镜的焦距。", ""]}